# Cursor reviews, never writes

In this repo Claude Code is the only code author. When Cursor runs here (normally
headless via `scripts/agent/review.py`, `agent -p --mode ask`), it is a reviewer:

- Do not edit, create, move or delete files. Do not commit or run state-changing commands.
- Return findings in the format the review prompt asks for (`scripts/agent/cursor_review_prompt.md`).

Never request, mention, or run Cursor Bugbot (`cursor[bot]`, `/review-bugbot`, `bugbot run`,
or the Bugbot subagent), and never post `cursor review` or `@greptileai` PR comments.
Greptile also runs locally only: `greptile review --branch origin/main --json`, via `scripts/agent/review.py`.
